{"availability":"available","full":"abigailhaddad/ufo-releases","name":"ufo-releases","description":"Searchable mirror of war.gov UAP/UFO declassified record index","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":1,"created":"2026-05-08T18:39:10Z","updated":"2026-10-08T20:38:16Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ufo-releases.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://ufo-releases.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.078Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.078Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.078Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.078Z","stars":1,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Searchable, sortable mirror of the declassified UAP records the U.S. Department of War publishes at war.gov/UFO.","The official site is JS-heavy and inconvenient to browse, so this site reads the same source CSV they ship and renders it as a normal table — with chip-style filters, full-text search across every PDF, and match highlighting.","What we host vs. what we link. The metadata table (titles, descriptions, agencies, dates) and the AI-transcribed PDF text are mirrored locally and shipped with the site. The actual source files (PDFs / images / videos) are uploaded to a public Cloudflare R2 bucket — — and the table also links to the originals on war.gov / dvidshub.net so you can verify provenance."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/abigailhaddad/ufo-releases/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"356c6113ba11753adaff875dcde9f72c87ef4432cf2346b9fa7d59cf230337e0","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.240Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.240Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Searchable, sortable mirror of the declassified UAP records the U.S. Department of War publishes at war.gov/UFO.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/abigailhaddad/ufo-releases/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"356c6113ba11753a